{"id":"11ad48f63b554ca7","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-lccc.md","title":"局部笛卡尔闭范畴","display":"df-lccc — 局部笛卡尔闭范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-lccc","aliases":["16-df-lccc","Locally cartesian closed category"],"display":"df-lccc — 局部笛卡尔闭范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-slice-category]]","[[16-df-ccc-definition]]"],"source":"Theorem 10.5.5(ii), pp. 627–628 (PDF 647–648)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-lccc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-lccc</span><span>Locally cartesian closed category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lccc — 局部笛卡尔闭范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem 10.5.5(ii), pp. 627–628 (PDF 647–648)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为范畴；有限极限、切片及 CCC 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{LCCC}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lccc}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C/I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lccc}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C/I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在此条件下每个拉回函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*:\\mathcal C/J\\to\\mathcal C/I\">\\(f^*:\\mathcal C/J\\to\\mathcal C/I\\)</span> 都有右伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_f\">\\(\\Pi_f\\)</span>。反过来，有限极限加这些右伴随给出所有切片的指数。</li>\n<li>本原子显式绑定原文件未定义的 <code>FinLim</code>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Theorem 10.5.5(ii), pp. 627–628 (PDF 647–648)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-slice-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴；有限极限、切片及 CCC 分别采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-slice-category]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴；有限极限、切片及 CCC 分别采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-slice-category]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴；有限极限、切片及 CCC 分别采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-slice-category]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-finite-limits]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinLim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LCCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lccc}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C/I).","display":true},{"tex":"f^*:\\mathcal C/J\\to\\mathcal C/I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_f","display":false}],"bytes":1420,"backlinks":[{"id":"f0505b34bfec84f1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LCCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-lccc]] 的规范定义，$\\mathrm{LCCC}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 在本页定义。"},{"id":"939ed0c717cef4ab","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-lccc|df-lccc — 局部笛卡尔闭范畴]]"},{"id":"7d83daba15e3a054","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LCCC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-lccc]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75e7c168ac56b22","0cd12b341f6289c0","18a4c8ba03fadf06"]}